  'A church dedicated to St. Peter in 1895 through the generosity of the rancher Pierre Wibaux, as a stained-glass window in the sacristy says. It was listed on the National Register in 1990. It was later used for catechism classes until some years after 2004.',
  'The original stained-glass window in the sacristy carries the 1895 dedication. Wikipedia says the nave and sanctuary have been restored to their original form. Exterior material not checked.',
  '',
